        <gc:SimpleValue>Persoal luggage and gifts accompanied by travelers, is not exempt from customs duties under the unified customs tariff; Goods transferred by express transport &gt; ( c) - Headings 98.01 and 98.02 apply, inter alia, to exports &gt; For International organizations &gt; Goods of a value less than 1000 Saudi Riyals (100 Omani Riyals) transported by express transport</gc:SimpleValue>
